==Rules==
{{StageRule|13thAnni}}

==Battleground==
*10 [[Kroxo]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
*1 [[Baron Face]] spawns as the boss after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*14 [[Kaijin Doge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*3 [[Hyppoh]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Elizabeth the LVIth]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*2 [[LeMurr]]s spawn after 56.67 seconds<sup>1,700f</sup>, delay 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage won't pose much of an issue as long as you've collected the [[Anti-unstarred Alien Treasures]] from [[Into the Future]] Chapter 1. Chip down Elizabeth with a combonation of [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Island Cats]] and [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Leg Cats]] while simultaniously stacking Nyanko Rangers on her (assuming you have [[Yellow Strike (Combo)|Yellow Strike]] to resist her Wave Attacks). Once she bites the dust, Baron Face won't be an issue.

